    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d732">

                <pb facs="1259" n="1212" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg1212"/>

                <head>732. Telegram 443 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d732-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-10-17">October 17, 1956. 7:09
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d732-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d732-1"/>
                <p>443. For Johnson.</p>
                <p>Latest Chinese Communist statement on Geneva talks seems to have fallen flat. Not
                    carried so far by any newspaper or wire service seen here. We plan ignore
                    statement if press continues to do so.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Dulles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
